 the United States and Central / South America, Bluelight is in an exciting phase of expansion, continually seeking exceptional talent to join its dynamic and diverse community.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eWe are looking for a skilled individual to join our rapidly growing team at Bluelight Consulting. This position is ideal for someone who thrives in a fast-paced, dynamic environment where everyone's opinions and efforts are valued and appreciated. You will have the opportunity to contribute to challenging and meaningful projects, developing high-quality applications that stand out in the market. We value continuous learning, personal growth, and hard work, offering a collaborative environment that promotes professional development. If you are passionate about software development and eager to be part of a growing software consultancy, we invite you to apply and join us on this exciting journey.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eWhat We Are Looking For\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cul\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003e3+ years of experience in testing Web Products.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eSolid knowledge of testing tools.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eDevelopment of test plans : the creation of test cases and debugging.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAdditional knowledge in Web technologies.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAbility to take extreme ownership over your work. Every day is a challenge to ensure you are performing to the expectations you and your team have agreed upon regarding estimates and the general process.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eAbility to identify with Bluelight's clients' goals and dedicate yourself to delivering on the commitments you and your team make to them.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eA positive mindset and a can-do attitude.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eForensic attention to detail.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003c/ul\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eCompany Benefits\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eCompetitive salary and bonuses, including performance-based salary increases.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eGenerous paid-time-off policy\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eFlexible working hours\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eWork remotely\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eContinuing education, training, conferences\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cli\\u003eCompany-sponsored coursework, exams, and certifications\\u003c/li\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eBeing a consultant in our team is a fun, challenging, and rewarding career choice. Your contributions are highly valued by clients, and the work you do often has a direct and significant impact on their business.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eYou will have the opportunity to work on a variety of projects for our incredible clients, which will accelerate your career growth. You’ll collaborate with modern technologies and work alongside some of the best professionals in the industry!\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003eIf you’re eager to be part of an exciting, challenging, and rapidly growing consultancy, we encourage you to apply. #LI-Remote\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e#J-18808-Ljbffr\\u003c/p\\u003e\",\"QA Manual Tester - Remote, Latin America\",null,null,0,[[\"organization\",\"Bluelight Consulting\"],[\"publisher_name\",\"Talent.com\"],[\"location_feature_id\",\"/google/oyster/feature/0x96626f6a7df81e51:0x60cdc26d444b83da\"],[\"cluster_id\",\"0x7990c350fbe22ddd\"]],0],[null,1,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1]],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA473\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15119900,0.07032148,4]]],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA493\":[\"https://cl.talent.com/view?id\\u003d0248125a4971\\u0026utm_campaign\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_medium\\u003dorganic\",null,\"Talent.com\",\"XBPbTl8Rj9XI4AmFAAAAAA\