CMBAGYD-FRp0kiJWQYIZCoRdIkMt1_dONdL2yO5LxalhejMx88qs-1a690B1qmBvyv6--3ghMAYSpJAgh01UkJmzPg1nRxjnVVEc1trGve5mcZHhZ3FO8rnQ68IyS2NAdT4elLjnuNw_OYc1unG3kKH_5irePewAAAA\",\"v1_ATWGeeO3vKIqQqaJ30yGnT8nlcrctmi8TEt6LRDsxk1SKQUXLQ\"]],[null,null,null,null,1]],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA469\":[[0,\"https://cl.bebee.com/job/11e03433194f1b3778e7763e43340293\",\"jobs\",\"754kDdp_Lc09IM\",\"Wand makes gaming magical. Through game customization and guidance, we build tools that helps players have more fun in their favorite games.\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur platform works across thousands of PC games, ensuring that great games are accessible to everyone, regardless of time constraints, skill level, or accessibility needs.\\u003c/p\\u003e We want to build the future of game assistance, and we're hoping you'll join us.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAbout Us\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eAt Wand, we're on a mission to make gaming more fun. \\u003cp\\u003eWe're building the world's ultimate game companion, where millions of PC gamers discover mind-blowing ways to play their favorite games.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eFounded with a community-first approach, Wand has become the go-to destination for gamers seeking safe and seamless ways to enhance their gaming experience.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eOur platform unites cutting-edge technology with unwavering security, transforming how players interact with games through innovative features like interactive maps and real-time mods.\\u003c/p\\u003e \\u003cp\\u003eWhat drives us is our deep commitment to the gaming community and our belief that everyone deserves access to extraordinary gaming experiences.\\u003c/p\\u003e We are all gamers at heart, dedicated to building a platform that continually surprises and delights our users.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eRole Overview\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eDo you love playing single-player video games and dream of making a living doing so?\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWe're seeking passionate QA Testers to help ensure our community has access to reliable, high-quality gaming experiences. This role focuses on testing and validating mods to enhance gameplay while maintaining Wand's commitment to safety and quality.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eKey Responsibilities\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eTest and validate game modifications across a wide range of PC titles\\u003cbr\\u003eMeet established performance metrics and testing KPIs\\u003cbr\\u003eDocument and report findings with detailed attention to functionality and user experience\\u003cbr\\u003eProvide structured feedback to improve mod instructions and descriptions\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWho You Are\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eA dedicated gamer with a deep understanding of video game mechanics\\u003cbr\\u003eStrong attention to detail and systematic approach to testing\\u003cbr\\u003eExcellent written and verbal communication skills in English\\u003cbr\\u003eStable high-speed internet connection (100Mb/s minimum)\\u003cbr\\u003ePC capable of running modern games and recording gameplay footage\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience using Discord for team collaboration\\u003cbr\\u003eSelf-motivated with strong time management skills\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eBonus Points\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eExperience with Wand or similar modding platforms\\u003cbr\\u003eBackground in software testing or quality assurance\\u003cbr\\u003eKnowledge of recording and streaming software\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWhat we offer\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eThe opportunity to play cutting-edge video games and explore immersive worlds as your job\\u003cbr\\u003eCompetitive compensation\\u003cbr\\u003eA flexible work environment that caters to your gaming schedule\\u003cbr\\u003eA chance to be part of a passionate community of gamers and creators\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eHow To Apply\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003ePlease submit your resume along with:\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eDetailed PC specifications:\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eStorage capacity\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cstrong\\u003eRAM\\u003c/strong\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eProcessor\\u003cbr\\u003eGraphics card\\u003cbr\\u003eInternet speed\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eJoin us in creating the ultimate PC gaming companion\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eWand is an equal opportunity employer committed to building a diverse and inclusive team. We welcome applications from all qualified candidates regardless of background.\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003eShow more Show less\",\"QA Tester\",null,null,0,[[\"organization\",\"Wand\"],[\"publisher_name\",\"BeBee CL\"],[\"location_feature_id\",\"/google/oyster/feature/0x9662c5410425af2f:0x8475d53c400f0931\"],[\"cluster_id\",\"0x6c786f2188754ac8\"]],0],[null,1,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1]],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA470\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15119900,0.117436625,4]]],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA490\":[\"https://cl.bebee.com/job/11e03433194f1b3778e7763e43340293?utm_campaign\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_medium\\u003dorganic\",null,\"BeBee CL\",\"zS1_2g0knu-ST-WpAAAAAA\\u003d\\u003d\",0,1],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA495\":[\"https://cl.trabajo.org/oferta-3806-580fff33f966f595901fa7ca51c2d6a0?utm_campaign\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_medium\\u003dorganic\",\"trabajo.org\",\"Trabajo.org - Vacantes De Empleo, Trabajo\",\"XN34zMOTwjQAAAAAAAAAAA\",0],\"h3Kfae6MB7DA5OUP5dDBkA4100\":[\"https://cl.expertini.com/job/qa-tester-santiago-de-chile-bruno-fritsch-4795-711143/?utm_campaign\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_source\\u003dgoogle_jobs_apply\\u0026utm_medium\\u00