 independent artists and labels worldwide.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   We’re passionate about music, but even more passionate about the people behind it. We’re looking for curious, driven, and collaborative individuals who want to build, learn, and grow with us. We believe diverse perspectives make better teams, better products, and better outcomes and we’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone belongs.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   Sound like you? Let’s talk.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   Prior to completing your application, please click \\u003cb\\u003eHERE\\u003c/b\\u003e to view our full Equal Employment Opportunity and Privacy Statement.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n    Compensation: Monthly gross (before taxes) \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e$\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e4,129,650.00 CLP\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eIn a Nutshell //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003eWe are looking for a \\u003cb\\u003eSoftware Developer\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e \\u003c/b\\u003edelight and empower our clients. The position reports to the Director of Software Development. This role will be based in \\u003cb\\u003eChile\\u003c/b\\u003e and work remotely, and report to the Director of Software Engineering. The \\u003cb\\u003eSoftware Developer\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e \\u003c/b\\u003ewill work remotely full-time and will come with some really cool perks, as well as ensuring that, as an individual, you have the proper work/life balance.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e What you will do //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eBuild new features for client and internal facing web applications.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eUtilize queues and workers to execute long running tasks.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eWork with a cross functional team of developers, product managers, and QA Analysts.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eEnsure high quality through code reviews, automated testing, and monitoring.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eDeploy new features behind feature flags in a CI/CD process.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eContribute to retrospectives and process improvements.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eWrite Laravel migrations to create and update MySQL tables.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eIntegrate with third parties using APIs and webhooks.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e What you need to have //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eMinimum 5 years of development experience with PHP 8+ and MVC frameworks, specifically Laravel 7+ or Symfony.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eGood verbal and written communication skills.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eExpertise with SQL, schema design, and data migrations.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eModerate experience with JavaScript and CSS.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eExperience researching and using third-party APIs.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eComfort working with a partially distributed team.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e What will set you apart //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eExperience working with feature flags in a CI/CD environment.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eFamiliarity with building dynamic interfaces with Laravel Livewire\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eExperience using AWS services, including S3, SQS, CloudWatch, etc.\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eUnderstanding of serverless technologies like AWS Fargate and Lambda\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eFluency using AI tools for efficient software development\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003eLove for music\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eAbout Symphonic //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cul\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e This position is open \\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eto candidates currently residing in Chile\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n  \\u003cli\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003eRelocation assistance is not available\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/li\\u003e\\n \\u003c/ul\\u003e\\n \\u003cbr\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cb\\u003e About Symphonic //\\u003c/b\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   Symphonic is a leading independent music distribution and marketing company founded in 2006 by music producer Jorge Brea in Tampa, Florida. With a “by artists, for artists” ethos, Symphonic provides a powerful platform for global distribution, content management, royalty collection, marketing, and label services tailored to independent creators.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   Proudly minority-owned and fully independent, Symphonic combines advanced technology with a hands-on approach that keeps artists and labels connected and supported at every stage. With a global presence across the U.S., Latin America, Brazil, Canada, the Caribbean, Europe, Africa, and Asia, Symphonic is committed to both technological innovation and meaningful engagement within the music communities it serves.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n \\u003cp\\u003e\\u003cbr\\u003e\\n   Check out more about us on our website at www.symdistro.com\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/div\\u003e\",\"Software Developer\",null,null,0,[[\"organization\",\"Symphonic Distribution\"],[\"organization_mid\",\"/m/010qcktj\"],[\"publisher_name\",\"Indeed\"],[\"location_feature_id\",\"/google/oyster/feature/0x9662c5410425af2f:0x8475d53c400f0931\"],[\"cluster_id\",\"0xdff3909b877a6073\"]],0],[null,1,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,[\"organization\",\"organization_mid\",\"publisher_name\",\"location_feature_id\",\"cluster_id\"],1,1,1]],\"Xt3nabi2AfPS1sQPntOBkQQ59\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15113200,0.5380256,4]]],\"Xt3nabi2AfPS1sQPntOBkQQ73\":[[\"https://www.google.com/search?ibp\\u003dhtl;jobs\\u0026q\\u003dDeveloper+Santiago,+Chile\\u0026htidocid\\u003dJZ4wRZlfS4c6mncZAAAAAA%3D%3D\\u0026hl\\u003des-419\\u0026shndl\\u003d37\\u0026shmd\\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_xXMsQ3CMBAAQNFmBKoXJUUMSDShjZQBMkBkO49t5PiN_wNhD6ahZTFIc-VV70117OkqT10QWnxgpIylAfP98H3GUcOIgFOOSIAJOiIXcXvxIpkbpZhj7Vi0BFtbmhQlNLSoGxleGdj_3xy14HA6H5Y6J7ff9a8pe0rBQhtYSjCzBEpr3-skQTv6AfBi6UKXAAAA\\u0026shmds\\u003dv1_ATWGeePG0n7IoyVtrnf8b_mmzGWiI4CGaQl1_sBjjJclBX3nmg\\u0026source\\u003dsh/x/job/uv/m5/1#fpstate\\u003dtldetail\\u0026htivrt\\u003djobs\\u0026htidocid\\u003dJZ4wRZlfS4c6mncZAAAAAA%3D%3D\\u0026htiq\\u003dDeveloper+Santiago,+Chile\",null,null,\"Software Developer\",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,[\"H4sIAAAAAAAA_xXMsQ3CMBAAQNFmBKoXJUUMSDShjZQBMkBkO49t5PiN_wNhD6ahZTFIc-VV70117OkqT10QWnxgpIylAfP98H3GUcOIgFOOSIAJOiIXcXvxIpkbpZhj7Vi0BFtbmhQlNLSoGxleGdj_3xy14HA6H5Y6J7ff9a8pe0rB